{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-11 18:25:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A LEADING AND LONGSTANDING FIRM, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 11, 2022) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-11 05:45:00', 'title': 'WFC LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ("WELLS FARGO" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WFC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF WELLS FARGO INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}